# Fix GN safe_browsing and building with safebrowsing disabled on macOS
#
# ungoogled-chromium-macos's fix-disabling-safebrowsing.patch at 31f01756a43d (its 156.0.8078.79
# tag), rebased by ilo onto Chromium 157.0.8103.50 until it tags 157. Changed from upstream's:
# - chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn's static_library("ui") and chrome/test/BUILD.gn's Mac unit_tests no
#   longer list the deps upstream's removes (157 folds ui's deps into //chrome/browser, and moves
#   archive_analyzer_results under safe_browsing_mode > 0), so those two hunks are gone.
# - 157 drops the ENTERPRISE_CLIENT_CERTIFICATES flag, so the two policy entries upstream's removes
#   are unguarded, ForBrowser under !IS_CHROMEOS; they're removed in that form. 157's
#   ManagedClientCertificateFor*Config entries, which upstream's predates, are left in.
